WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.928
We are eating at a restaurant. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:05.928 --> 00:00:10.272
A waiter meets us and shows us to a table.

3
00:00:10.272 --> 00:00:17.592
We look at the menu and choose our food. Choosing before we arrive is also okay.

4
00:00:17.592 --> 00:00:22.344
The waiter writes down our order and brings drinks.

5
00:00:22.344 --> 00:00:28.176
We wait and talk, or look at our things, while the food cooks.

6
00:00:28.176 --> 00:00:35.328
The food arrives. If something is not right, we can say so politely.

7
00:00:35.328 --> 00:00:41.136
When we finish, we say: can we have the bill, please.

8
00:00:41.136 --> 00:00:46.104
We pay at the table or at the desk, and then we leave.

9
00:00:46.104 --> 00:00:54.312
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

